  "description": "To fulfill a promise made by his first love who agreed to grant him a wish if he enrolled in her university, a notorious fighter named Yong Bum decides to study for the very first time. Since he has never touched a textbook before, he sets out to recruit elite, top tier private tutors for every subject. Alongside these expert instructors, the legendary fighter begins his chaotic journey to conquer the college entrance exams.\n\n**Original Webtoon**:    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852547), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14437935)",
